{"meta":{"id":"sealed-interface","category":"it/syntax/java/type-combination","title":"sealed interface (유니온 대용) · Java","subtitle":"(JAVA)","summary":"permits 로 구현 타입을 제한해 \"이 중 하나\" 표현 + switch 패턴 매칭","tags":["java","f-union","f-interface"],"color":"indigo","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-indigo","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-indigo-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-indigo-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 border border-indigo-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></span>JAVA</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">sealed interface (유니온 대용) · Java</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-indigo-50/70 border border-indigo-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> permits 로 구현 타입을 제한해 &quot;이 중 하나&quot; 표현 + switch 패턴 매칭</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">sealed interface — 유니온 대용 (Java 17+)</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">java</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">public sealed interface Result permits Success, Failure {}\r\npublic record Success(String data) implements Result {}\r\npublic record Failure(String message) implements Result {}\r\n\r\nString handle(Result r) {\r\n    return switch (r) {                    // 모든 경우를 다뤘는지 컴파일러가 확인 (Java 21)\r\n        case Success s -&gt; s.data();\r\n        case Failure f -&gt; f.message();\r\n    };\r\n}</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">구현 가능한 타입을 정해 두어 \"이 중 하나\" 를 표현한다</p><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> TypeScript › 유니온 타입 — 구분된 유니온</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/java/type-combination/sealed-interface","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"java","title":"JAVA","path":"it/syntax/java"},{"id":"type-combination","title":"타입 조합 · 제한","path":"it/syntax/java/type-combination"}],"hasImage":false}